Explosive growth of unstructured and semi-structured data (web, social media, IoT)
Need for massive horizontal scalability that RDBMS could not provide cost-effectively
Demand for high write throughput and low latency
Flexible schema requirements for agile development
Rise of Big Data, Cloud Computing, and distributed systems
Desire to reduce impedance mismatch between application objects and storage
Cost of proprietary RDBMS licenses and high-end hardware
